  "details": "Screenshots 1 & 2.\n\nMissing Crowdin String \"Recent\" for the Emoji Section of the Wing Menu causing no translation.\n\nScreenshots 3 & 4.\n\nMissing Crowdin String \"Recent\" for the Stickers Section of the Wing Menu therefore having no translation.\n\nScreenshots 5 & 6.\n\nMissing Crowdin Strings for Month Selection leading to untranslated months within Calendar Section of the Group Menu & Calendar Menu.\n\nScreenshots 7, 8 & 9.\n\nFilters \"Added\", \"Featured\" and \"Groups\" within View, Filters \"Public\" and \"Group\" within Access Type, Filters \"Arts\", \"Avatars\", \"Dance\", \"Education\", \"Exploring\", \"Film & Media\", \"Gaming\", \"Hangout\", \"Music\", \"Other\", \"Performances\", \"Roleplaying\" and \"Wellness\" within Categories are all untranslated even though their Crowdin Strings are translated and seem to exist.",
